a&_nc_ohc=N1MXZViXRd4Q7kNvwHIqnfj&_nc_oc=AdqENgTvDlkFE1th5Iisi4ropq92zAkXKzLsdDgiXyIKGHKSElrwI5_eqFY4zC-ORj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN-HJ8E4DN7p45ktzy-wxil5UwKgDVKSXiQmaPXumv20Q&oe=6ABFC346"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_007_0003.png", "id": "845763184505694", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_845763187839027_468447991220621964_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cZBECPzF_aMQ7kNvwHS4O5U&_nc_oc=AdqGdDWmYrygZQUfEJle_-t80n11GikFh62zPO1l-1NBd0UOLLnTTIs2aMAWzXB6WHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOpUOw_DvE3TyGRFBRaSOHXtdHtEmPbgRCzk761eIa1Lg&oe=6ABFB0AC"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_003_0002.png", "id": "1836602476962685", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_1836602480296018_8280261062432359374_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4XsWiU51DVUQ7kNvwF6CgBy&_nc_oc=Adr7G6uAUrCPBu_H1vD4i9TK1Ge0ZrRDqhv9QOIAjFeuh61jGTU4ngg3nke9LJXRB3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcl7MNV2LzmPaZ45SXSqkS-_zizQOviKejmYG7O3PsQg&oe=6ABFAD83"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_004_0000.png", "id": "1138993271704566", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1138993275037899_3311993198849045458_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3KNkdiCZfmgQ7kNvwEN-8eC&_nc_oc=Adr4-DbJbKpIdVwUlqD9NdHROnoiaQT57ASYDzkm1_rl2z0aZnJvKcAuz4iqtmaZcUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMFapeauOB5dnNBeBGS8VRJbEiPQTExminfprSfAyS7Aw&oe=6ABFB093"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_006_0001.png", "id": "847449181015275", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_847449184348608_15613528115627936_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-x9LCuP739oQ7kNvwFVJgY0&_nc_oc=AdqerP9BNuDoJxzH5lIAq_UJ4qg0oH6c-9uZhRtLxuLZxFYxiFqHFxYkbZvutm5QmPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMGhFEhXNog6Zwydrlpc_raxKnuQNmLThCq09qj_8ScfQ&oe=6ABFAA01"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zibby", "keywords": ["social", "casual", "free", "gorilla", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Zibby!\n\nZibby is not just game. Zibby is lifestyle. Enter the world, be the Zibby.\n\n# Bonk & Snack\nSee that Spitflower? It has gems inside. BONK the Spitflower. Gem falls out? Don't put in pocket. EAT IT. Crunchy victory.\n\n{847821848000023}\n\n# Shop Like a Boss\nWhy look boring? Go to store. We have everything! Buy funny hat. Buy cool gadget. Buy shiny things. Look fresh, impress friends. Spend your hard-earned cash here.\n\n{1280599737210708}\n\n# Dig Deep, Eat Dark\nGrab pickaxe. Find rock. Smash rock! Oh look, coal pieces! Are you hungry? Yes. Eat the coal. Mining is tasty work.\n\n{2308405566240054}\n\n# Zoom and Boing\nWalking is for slow people. Use Jumppad: BOING! Fly high. Use Zipline: WHOOSH! Go fast. Explore the world like a pro. Never touch ground again.\n\n{722552094239314}\n\n# The Circle of Life\nSimple life. Good life. Walk -> Grab -> Bonk Mob -> EAT. Mine Rock -> Get Coal -> EAT. -> Sell loot -> Get rich -> Repeat. This is the Zibby way.\n\n{3001593293368798}\n\n**Rise through the skies. Serve the kingdom. Become Zibby.**\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Explore floating island biomes as Zibby, servant of the kingdom. Team up with friends to hunt monsters, mine rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast sky-realm. Collect valuable drops, sell them in the castle safe zone, and upgrade your gear. New islands, enemies, and tools arrive with every update\u2014your adventure never stops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"